{"2301540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hunting Bigfoot", "steam_appid": 2301540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After a military transport got struck by Bigfoot You were left as the only survivor. Now it's up to You to hunt down Bigfoot and put an end on the rogue creature.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is the key to your success. Your gear consists of anything from medkits to flares and weapons. Use different weapon types  and setup explosives to gain the advantage during an encounter with Bigfoot. Use your trustworthy gps to locate points of interests along with tracking bigfoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit multiple locations, and explore beautiful landscapes. Be on the lookout for points of interest to find loot, unlock new objectives and respawn points along with hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to hunt down Bigfoot but through all the carnage there is still important tasks to complete alongside the hunt. Side objectives can vary from locating fallen soldiers to collecting samples from the local wildlife for research purpose. New objectives can be found by exploring the map and locating various points of interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After a military transport got struck by Bigfoot You were left as the only survivor. Now it's up to You to hunt down Bigfoot and put an end on the rogue creature.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is the key to your success. Your gear consists of anything from medkits to flares and weapons. Use different weapon types  and setup explosives to gain the advantage during an encounter with Bigfoot. Use your trustworthy gps to locate points of interests along with tracking bigfoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit multiple locations, and explore beautiful landscapes. Be on the lookout for points of interest to find loot, unlock new objectives and respawn points along with hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to hunt down Bigfoot but through all the carnage there is still important tasks to complete alongside the hunt. Side objectives can vary from locating fallen soldiers to collecting samples from the local wildlife for research purpose. New objectives can be found by exploring the map and locating various points of interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Roaming through the night hunting for his next victim, Bigfoot has gone rogue and it's up to You to end it all.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301540/f176fbdcb1556ba7b23f10c6b608a22432a3fbe8/header.jpg?t=1788210926", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301540/db10302a8df470ac90c7b49faee5b1fa0720975d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788210926", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301540/db10302a8df470ac90c7b49faee5b1fa0720975d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788210926", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Laituri Games"], "publishers": ["La